topic: ohos-elf-sign-owner-execute-bit
symptom: Conan test_package returns Error 126 after successful upstream records
root_cause: mode | 0o055 can leave owner execute unset for a 0644 ELF
fix: use mode | 0o755 in both signed and already-signed paths
validation: targeted old/new mode checks plus r67 OHOS upstream 24/24 and installed-package flow 1/1 on HEAD 226472fc71c00d0d73a2a5604665fce3fda8e02b
